00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.560
Like, it's very hard. It's very easy to lose those small pieces.

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:35.280
And so stack-up is actually, like, it's one of those high-fetching, you know?

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:36.400
Like, if you want the complete thing.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.860
I mean, some people just collect the carts, and that's enough for them.

