Like, just, like, the fact that some 8-year-old, 9-year-old, 10-year-old, I don't know how old people are when they play this game, kid, is actually interacting with a robot through a computer, which is so 80s cool.

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:28.780
Right. Like, they need that pure experience to just, like, yeah, this is the future.

