is this is a novelty.

00:29:40.940 --> 00:29:42.200
This is a gimmick.

00:29:42.300 --> 00:29:43.840
It's not fun anymore.

00:29:43.840 --> 00:29:47.460
It barely held up probably the year after Rob came out.

00:29:47.580 --> 00:29:53.620
And that's dangerous for Nintendo at this point in their company's development.

