00:30:43.120 --> 00:30:45.880
Nobody calls out anything, like, you know, left foot red.

00:30:46.040 --> 00:30:46.980
You're just doing it.

00:30:47.200 --> 00:30:49.920
You're just saying, oh, I'm going to put my left foot on red now.

00:30:50.100 --> 00:30:52.860
And like, I'm going to put my right hand on green.

00:30:52.860 --> 00:30:55.020
And it's like, it just, it's not fun.

00:30:55.220 --> 00:30:59.660
You need something to tell you to do something hard, and you need someone to be watching you.

00:30:59.980 --> 00:31:03.760
Yeah, it's almost like saying that, like, oh, yeah, yeah, I've got a PlayStation.

00:31:04.260 --> 00:31:09.120
But like, then that person that you're telling that comes over to your house, and you just have like an old controller.

00:31:10.840 --> 00:31:13.340
And you don't press the X-Men, and you move a block.

00:31:14.280 --> 00:31:15.500
We have to act it out.

00:31:15.740 --> 00:31:19.280
Yeah. I don't have a PlayStation.

00:31:19.480 --> 00:31:21.000
I just have like, this is where I play.

00:31:21.100 --> 00:31:23.040
This is a PlayStation. This is my PlayStation.

00:31:23.060 --> 00:31:25.300
This is the eat station, and it's the sit station.

00:31:25.560 --> 00:31:30.500
That would be like the equivalent of like naming your like after school daycare PlayStation.

00:31:30.920 --> 00:31:33.360
You know, the kids would just be like, well, we're going to PlayStation.

00:31:33.780 --> 00:31:35.180
And it's like, yeah, we're going to PlayStation.

00:31:35.180 --> 00:31:38.920
And you go there, and it's like, you know, there's a couple of, there's a couple blocks.

00:31:39.140 --> 00:31:43.620
And the teacher's like, we're going to play stack the blocks in color-coded order while I knock them down.

00:31:44.540 --> 00:31:46.940
All right. It's four resounding no's.

00:31:47.280 --> 00:31:51.140
No surprise. Gyromite also got three resounding no's.

00:31:51.140 --> 00:31:52.640
It's because Sam wasn't here, unfortunately.

00:31:53.060 --> 00:31:56.500
So you can really tell that Rob is a must-buy.

